{"parse": {"title": "Small salvage", "pageid": 572049, "revid": 15357642, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Item\n|name = Small salvage\n|image = [[File:Small salvage.png]]\n|release = [[19 November]] [[2025]]\n|update = Sailing is OUT TODAY!\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = No\n|noteable = No\n|options = Drop\n|examine = Salvage from a small shipwreck. You can sort through it at a salvaging station.\n|value = 200\n|weight = 3.000\n|id = 32847\n|leagueRegion = No\n}}\n[[File:Small salvage detail.png|130px|left]]\n'''Small salvage''' is an item recovered from [[small shipwreck]]s via [[shipwreck salvaging]]. Level 15 [[Sailing]] is required to salvage these, granting 10 experience.\n\nWhen sorted at a [[salvaging station]] (or the [[Salvaging station (facility)|boat facility]]), players will additionally receive 5.5 Sailing experience and loot.\n\nAs with all salvage, small salvage can be stored in your ship's [[Cargo hold]].\n\n==Sailing info==\n{{Sailing info\n|name = Small salvage\n|level = 15\n|xp = 5.5\n|shipwreck = [[Small shipwreck]]\n|facility = [[Salvaging station]]\n}}\n== Money making ==\n{{Mmgsection|Salvaging small shipwrecks}}\n\n==Loot==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=1374142}}\n\n{{Average drop value|killname=|mobname=small salvage}}\n\n{{Average drop value|killname=|mobname=small salvage|alch=true}}\n\n===Pre-roll===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Boat bottle (empty)|quantity=1|rarity=1/750|skill=Sailing|raritynotes={{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/sailing-xp-review--further-fixes?oldschool=1|title=Sailing XP Review & Further Fixes|newsdate=3 December 2025|quote=Let's talk drop rates!|name=droprateblog}}}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Sailors' amulet (inert)|quantity=1|rarity=1/2000|altrarity=Never|skill=Sailing|gemw=no|raritynotes={{Refn|name=droprateblog}}{{Refn|group=d|Duplicate sailor's amulets will not be rolled if the player already owns a sailors' amulet.}}}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Rusty locket|quantity=1|rarity=1/3000|skill=Sailing|gemw=no|raritynotes={{Refn|name=droprateblog}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Shipbuilding===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Bronze bar|quantity=1|rarity=200/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Bronze nails|quantity=1-5|rarity=200/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Logs|quantity=1|rarity=200/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Iron nails|quantity=1-5|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Plank|quantity=1|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Oak logs|quantity=1|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Sawmill coupon (wood plank)|quantity=1|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Iron bar|quantity=1|rarity=50/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Oak plank|quantity=1|rarity=50/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Sawmill coupon (oak plank)|quantity=1|rarity=50/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Steel bar|quantity=1|rarity=1/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes and ammunition===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Air rune|quantity=1-10|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Water rune|quantity=1-10|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Bronze cannonball|quantity=2-7|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Iron cannonball|quantity=2-7|rarity=50/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Steel arrow|quantity=1-5|rarity=20/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Coins|quantity=1-200|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=100/1721|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=beginner|rarity=1/300|skill=Sailing|raritynotes={{Refn|name=droprateblog}}}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Soup|quantity=1|rarity=1/800000|skill=Sailing|raritynotes={{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runesca